# pseudocode source: chapters/ch81.tex:103
# caption: Normalize strings with a documented leftmost rule-order strategy.

REQUIRE finite string rules with nonempty left sides; input; nonnegative fuel
ENSURE selected normal form, or intermediate string with incomplete status
WHILE fuel remains DO
  enumerate matching occurrences and their rule indices
  IF none exist THEN
    return current string and complete
  END IF
  select minimum start offset, then minimum rule index
  replace exactly that occurrence; decrement fuel
END WHILE
test whether any occurrence remains; report completeness accordingly

